  <p>We try to keep the prompts and guides correct and up to date, but ChatGPT changes often. A tip that worked last month may not work today. We may change or remove content at any time without notice.</p>
  <h2>Errors and omissions</h2>
  <p>We are a small independent site, so mistakes happen. We do not accept responsibility for errors, gaps or anything out of date. If you spot one, please tell us and we will fix it as soon as we can.</p>
  <h2>Use at your own risk</h2>
  <p>You use the prompts and the site at your own risk. To the extent allowed by law, we are not liable for loss or harm that comes from using them. Some practical safety tips:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Keep a copy of your original photo before you edit it.</li>
    <li>Do not upload photos that show private documents, bank details, addresses or other sensitive information to any AI tool.</li>
    <li>Read OpenAI's privacy settings before you upload photos of other people.</li>
    <li>Check each result for odd details, such as changed faces or garbled text, before you share it.</li>
